{"id":"c15eb5eee7745cb7","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Deciding Dense Set","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set — ZFC Forcing12 Deciding Dense Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set — ZFC Forcing12 Deciding Dense Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-deciding-dense-set — ZFC Forcing12 Deciding Dense Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,M,P,\\leq_P,\\Sigma,\\varphi \\in V\">\\(D,M,P,\\leq_P,\\Sigma,\\varphi \\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in M\">\\(P\\in M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P}\\subseteq P\\times V\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P}\\subseteq P\\times V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DecidingDenseSet}_S \\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DecidingDenseSet}_S \\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}deciding\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DecidingDenseSet}_S(D,M,P,\\leq_P,\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow P\\in M\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land D=\\{p\\in P:\\langle p,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,P}\\lor\\langle p,\\neg\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,P}\\}\\land\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}deciding\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DecidingDenseSet}_S(D,M,P,\\leq_P,\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow P\\in M\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land D=\\{p\\in P:\\langle p,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,P}\\lor\\langle p,\\neg\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,P}\\}\\land\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set of conditions deciding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> is explicitly required to be dense in the forcing order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targ